<SimplePage
  title="Warm Hearts Program - Gene Johnson"
  description="Gene Johnson's Warm Hearts program provides free furnace and water heater repair or replacement to Puget Sound households facing financial hardship."
  path="/about-us/community/warm-hearts/"
  eyebrow="Community · Warm Hearts"
  tagline="No family should have to go without heat or hot water over a repair bill they can't cover."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", href: "/" },
    { name: "About Us", href: "/about-us/" },
    { name: "Community", href: "/about-us/community/" },
    { name: "Warm Hearts" },
  ]}
>
  <p>
    Warm Hearts is our way of extending the same fix-it-right standard to households who can't currently afford a major repair. Each year, we select qualifying households in the greater Puget Sound area to receive a free furnace or water heater repair or replacement, no strings attached.
  </p>

  <h2>Who qualifies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Households facing documented financial hardship</li>
    <li>A failed or failing furnace or water heater with no ability to cover repair or replacement costs</li>
    <li>Priority given to households with young children, elderly residents, or medical needs affected by lack of heat or hot water</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to apply or nominate someone</h2>
  <p>
    Applications and nominations are accepted through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> - let us know the household's situation and the best way to reach them, and our team will follow up to walk through next steps.
  </p>
</SimplePage>
